  IF SEQ-TOTAL BEATS STRETCH, the product argument cashes and the axis count
  is a real lever under the right protocol. IF ALL THREE ARE NULL, more axes
  buy nothing behaviourally however they are taught, and §41's arithmetic is
  a statement about code space alone -- which would close the vocabulary line
  with a mechanism rather than a tally.
